{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "The Sovereign",
    "steam_appid": 3815290,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815290/extras/3a0db4e403db5b653dfc5ea269e2010a.poster.avif?t=1751581268\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815290/extras/3a0db4e403db5b653dfc5ea269e2010a.webm?t=1751581268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815290/extras/3a0db4e403db5b653dfc5ea269e2010a.mp4?t=1751581268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Discover a shattered continent where maddened fragments of the Sovereign's soul spread their cursed influence across every corner of the land. Face them in tactical turn-based battles where every choice can be fatal and every mistake unforgivable. As you level up, you will choose from random upgrades across three distinct skill trees; the deeper you go in one, the stronger and rarer the buffs become. Unique weapons and equipment drastically alter your combat approach, offering new synergies and situational advantages. Throughout your journey, you will encounter dynamic events with multiple possible outcomes, decisions that not only shape the course of your campaign but also directly affect the behavior of bosses who respond to your actions with unique and unpredictable reactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815290/extras/37b634e61fa58ef5c9af87f2b1660e0e.avif?t=1751581268\" width=800 height=101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815290/extras/d35c8246838361f48132615197f6dead.poster.avif?t=1751581268\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815290/extras/d35c8246838361f48132615197f6dead.webm?t=1751581268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815290/extras/d35c8246838361f48132615197f6dead.mp4?t=1751581268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>You start with simple weapons and timid skills, but this is only the beginning. As you learn, improve, and fail, you gain access to powers that transform the fight. Some abilities completely change how you play, requiring precise tactical choices. Others carry great risks but offer devastating rewards for those who know when to use them. At your peak, your attacks become atomic forces, capable of leveling the battlefield and bending fate in your favor, but everything comes at a price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815290/extras/3c46992816bff10ff838513412b9167e.avif?t=1751581268\" width=800 height=101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815290/extras/5d62484d807884b33c44ee357c2f44ba.poster.avif?t=1751581268\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815290/extras/5d62484d807884b33c44ee357c2f44ba.webm?t=1751581268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815290/extras/5d62484d807884b33c44ee357c2f44ba.mp4?t=1751581268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>More than one hundred random events test your judgment and courage. Every decision, every move you make is meticulously recorded: your used skills, fighting patterns, failures, and triumphs. The Sovereign's fragments are not mere obstacles; they are entities that watch, judge, and react. They may grant unexpected blessings to those they deem worthy or cast cruel curses on those who earn their disdain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815290/extras/be493acf484ed1a22febab3d2fa427b1.avif?t=1751581268\" width=800 height=101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815290/extras/cf2faf81d7691484ff7b0de773c90b7f.poster.avif?t=1751581268\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815290/extras/cf2faf81d7691484ff7b0de773c90b7f.webm?t=1751581268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815290/extras/cf2faf81d7691484ff7b0de773c90b7f.mp4?t=1751581268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>All game mechanics intertwine to create an experience shaped by your choices: your powers, builds, blessings, and curses, together with unpredictable events that challenge your judgment. The intelligence of the Sovereign\u2019s fragments watches every move, every decision, adapting challenges and rewards to your playstyle.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815290/extras/3a0db4e403db5b653dfc5ea269e2010a.poster.avif?t=1751581268\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815290/extras/3a0db4e403db5b653dfc5ea269e2010a.webm?t=1751581268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815290/extras/3a0db4e403db5b653dfc5ea269e2010a.mp4?t=1751581268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Discover a shattered continent where maddened fragments of the Sovereign's soul spread their cursed influence across every corner of the land. Face them in tactical turn-based battles where every choice can be fatal and every mistake unforgivable. As you level up, you will choose from random upgrades across three distinct skill trees; the deeper you go in one, the stronger and rarer the buffs become. Unique weapons and equipment drastically alter your combat approach, offering new synergies and situational advantages. Throughout your journey, you will encounter dynamic events with multiple possible outcomes, decisions that not only shape the course of your campaign but also directly affect the behavior of bosses who respond to your actions with unique and unpredictable reactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815290/extras/37b634e61fa58ef5c9af87f2b1660e0e.avif?t=1751581268\" width=800 height=101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815290/extras/d35c8246838361f48132615197f6dead.poster.avif?t=1751581268\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815290/extras/d35c8246838361f48132615197f6dead.webm?t=1751581268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815290/extras/d35c8246838361f48132615197f6dead.mp4?t=1751581268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>You start with simple weapons and timid skills, but this is only the beginning. As you learn, improve, and fail, you gain access to powers that transform the fight. Some abilities completely change how you play, requiring precise tactical choices. Others carry great risks but offer devastating rewards for those who know when to use them. At your peak, your attacks become atomic forces, capable of leveling the battlefield and bending fate in your favor, but everything comes at a price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815290/extras/3c46992816bff10ff838513412b9167e.avif?t=1751581268\" width=800 height=101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815290/extras/5d62484d807884b33c44ee357c2f44ba.poster.avif?t=1751581268\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815290/extras/5d62484d807884b33c44ee357c2f44ba.webm?t=1751581268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815290/extras/5d62484d807884b33c44ee357c2f44ba.mp4?t=1751581268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>More than one hundred random events test your judgment and courage. Every decision, every move you make is meticulously recorded: your used skills, fighting patterns, failures, and triumphs. The Sovereign's fragments are not mere obstacles; they are entities that watch, judge, and react. They may grant unexpected blessings to those they deem worthy or cast cruel curses on those who earn their disdain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815290/extras/be493acf484ed1a22febab3d2fa427b1.avif?t=1751581268\" width=800 height=101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815290/extras/cf2faf81d7691484ff7b0de773c90b7f.poster.avif?t=1751581268\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815290/extras/cf2faf81d7691484ff7b0de773c90b7f.webm?t=1751581268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815290/extras/cf2faf81d7691484ff7b0de773c90b7f.mp4?t=1751581268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>All game mechanics intertwine to create an experience shaped by your choices: your powers, builds, blessings, and curses, together with unpredictable events that challenge your judgment. The intelligence of the Sovereign\u2019s fragments watches every move, every decision, adapting challenges and rewards to your playstyle.</p>",
